  (LATER THAT DAY)

  SEPTEMBER 10, 2025

  Baron Coleman: Israel IP Addresses Searched

  Tyler Robinson & Related Terms

  Coleman presented data and analysis from Google Trends and

  other tools showing searches from Israel for Tyler Robinson and

  related terms (hospital, lawyers, officials) in late July and early

  August.

  EVIDENCED BUT NOT PROVEN

  Evidence of search activity exists,

  but the source, methodology, and

  attribution are disputed. Not

  independently proven.

  Hamptons Gathering with Bill Ackman

  Charlie Kirk attended a gathering hosted by Bill Ackman in the

  Hamptons. Later accounts characterized it as an Israel-related

  "intervention." Ackman confirmed the meeting but denied any

  threats or blackmail.

  CONFIRMED MEETING

  Characterization of what

  happened is disputed.

  Harrison Smith Post

  was told by someone close to Charlie Kirk that

  Charlie thinks Israel will kill him if he turns against them."

  The post is documented, but Smith did not name his source

  and the claim is secondhand.

  POST CONFIRMED

  Underlying claim

  unverified

  Netanyahu Invitation Call

  Benjamin Netanyahu said he spoke with Charlie Kirk

  "two weeks" before September 10 and invited him

  to visit Israel.

  CONFIRMED BY NETANYAHU

  Approximate date based on

  "two weeks before Sept 10."

  John Yep on Charlie Kirk's Theological Shift (According to Yep)

  • Summer 2025 (approx. June-July): Yep says Charlie began asking deeper

  questions about Catholic theology, Church history, and the relationship

  between Christianity and Israel.

  • July-August 2025: Conversations intensified. Yep describes Kirk as

  increasingly questioning dispensationalism and political Zionism while

  becoming more interested in Catholicism.

  • August-early September 2025: Yep portrays Charlie as moving significantly

  closer to Catholicism, though he does not claim Charlie had formally begun

  the conversion process.

  • About one week before September 10, 2025: Separately from Yep, Bishop

  Joseph Brennan's brother reported that the bishop recalled Charlie saying

  he was "this close" to becoming Catholic during a private conversation.

  ACCOUNTS BY OTHERS

  Yep's retrospective account.

  Disputed by TPUSA Faith

  (Sr. Dir. Lucas Miles).

  Multi-Part Text Conversation

  Screenshots of a multi-part text conversation showed

  Charlie Kirk telling associates (including Josh Hammer)

  that he would no longer support the pro-Israel cause

  under the current conditions.

  CONFIRMED

  Confirmed by Andrew Kolvet

  as authentic.

  Zoom Call with Rabbi Pesach Wolicki

  (and Josh Hammer)

  Rabbi Wolicki said he spoke with Kirk for about an hour

  about answering Israel-related questions during Kirk's

  upcoming campus tour.

  Alleged Signal Message

  Commentators later alleged Kirk wrote in a Signal chat,

  "They're gonna get me tomorrow."

  No authenticated record of this message has been published.

  Charlie Kirk is Killed

  Kirk was fatally shot during an event at Utah Valley University.

  Netanyahu later publicly confirmed the recent invitation

  to Israel.

  CALL CORROBORATED

  Confirmed by Rabbi

  Wolicki.

  UNVERIFIED CLAIM

  No authenticated record

  available.

  CONFIRMED EVENT

  Widely reported.

